  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 120 ÷ 15 + 60 - 4 × 2 = 135 \n\nNow, by interchanging the signs\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and ×\n\n120 ÷ 15 + 60 - 4 × 2 = 135 ⇒ **120 ÷ 15**__ × 60 - 4 + 2 = 135\n\n__**8 ×**____** 60**__ - 4 + 2 = 135\n\n__**480 + 2**__ - 4 = 135\n\n__**482 - 4**__ = 135\n\n478 ≠ 135 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ÷ and -​\n\n120 ÷ 15 + 60 - 4 × 2 = 135 ⇒ 120 - 15 + **60 ÷ 4**__ × 2 = 135\n\n120 - 15 + __15____** × 2**__ = 135\n\n__**120 + 30**__ - 15 = 135\n\n__**150 - 15**__ = 135\n\n**135 = 135 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ and × \n\n120 ÷ 15 + 60 - 4 × 2 = 135 ⇒ 120 × 15 + 60 - **4 ÷ 2**__ = 135\n\n__**120 ×**____** 15**__ + 60 - 2 = 135\n\n__**1800 + 60**__ - 2 = 135\n\n__**1860 - 2**__ = 135\n\n1858 ≠ 135 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n\n \n• Option - (4) : × and -\n\n120 ÷ 15 + 60 - 4 × 2 = 135 ⇒ **120 ÷ 15**__ + 60 × 4 - 2 = 135\n\n8 + __**60 **____**×**____** 4**__ - 2 = 135\n\n__**8 + 240**__ - 2 = 135\n\n__**248 - 2**__ = 135\n\n246 ≠ 135 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
